{"id":"n40815-1-15","stage":5,"title":"논증 · 论证","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40815-1-15-1","ko":"앞으로 민준이가 어떤 논리를 펼치는지 한번 지켜보자.","zh":"以后我们就来看看敏俊会提出什么样的逻辑吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"논리를","meaning":"逻辑","explanation":"논리：逻辑；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"논리","audio":"/audio/3bb33e223557d76df343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28318","senseId":"1","lemma":"논리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"펼치는지","meaning":"展示，展现","explanation":"펼치다：展示，展现；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"펼치다","audio":"/audio/78ef364310c87c95d42e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88045","senseId":"3","lemma":"펼치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지켜보자.","meaning":"关注","explanation":"지켜보다：关注；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"지켜보다","audio":"/audio/1537124955a8698cceb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28943","senseId":"2","lemma":"지켜보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"3bb33e223557d76d","term":"논리","zh":"逻辑","audio":"/audio/3bb33e223557d76df343.mp3","entryId":"28318","definition":"进行正确判断、使想法合乎道理的思维过程或原理。","pronunciation":["놀리"]},{"id":"78ef364310c87c95","term":"펼치다","zh":"展示，展现","audio":"/audio/78ef364310c87c95d42e.mp3","entryId":"88045","definition":"为了让人看、听或享受而在人前表现出能吸引注意的状态。","pronunciation":["펼치다"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"1537124955a8698c","term":"지켜보다","zh":"关注","audio":"/audio/1537124955a8698cceb9.mp3","entryId":"28943","definition":"注意观察某事的进程。","pronunciation":["지켜보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/03a4cfc74dc0a3b7cb66.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40815-1-15-2","ko":"내 생각에 그는 처음부터 잘못된 논증을 내세웠어.","zh":"我觉得他从一开始就用了错误的论证。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각에","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그는","meaning":"他","explanation":"그：他；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처음부터","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못된","meaning":"出错，失败","explanation":"잘못되다：出错，失败；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못되다","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91481","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"논증을","meaning":"论证","explanation":"논증：论证；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"논증","audio":"/audio/771a345021a242a06cfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40815","senseId":"1","lemma":"논증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내세웠어.","meaning":"打着，推出","explanation":"내세우다：打着，推出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"내세우다","audio":"/audio/9337910cbf0477b7cdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40287","senseId":"3","lemma":"내세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，念头，心思","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"他","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代对话双方以外的人。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"907b4e753781c8cd","term":"잘못되다","zh":"出错，失败","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3","entryId":"91481","definition":"事情错误或失败。","pronunciation":["잘몯뙤다","잘몯뛔다"]},{"id":"771a345021a242a0","term":"논증","zh":"论证","audio":"/audio/771a345021a242a06cfe.mp3","entryId":"40815","definition":"举出逻辑性强的理由来证明某个主张或理论的对与错；或指其根据或理由。","pronunciation":["논증"]},{"id":"9337910cbf0477b7","term":"내세우다","zh":"打着，推出","audio":"/audio/9337910cbf0477b7cdac.mp3","entryId":"40287","definition":"提出某种意见或主张，并予以支持。","pronunciation":["내ː세우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/02387315991aa603d42f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.391,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40815","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2177,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得他从一开始就用了错误的论证。","那个军人不知度过多少次生死关头了。","以后我们就来看看敏俊会提出什么样的逻辑吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得他从一开始就用了错误的论证。","以后我们就来看看敏俊会提出什么样的逻辑吧。","那个军人不知度过多少次生死关头了。"],"answer":0}]}
